sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Orchestrator
    participant MM as MemoryManager
    participant LTM as LongTermMemory
    participant INJ as Injection
    participant EXT as MemoryExtractor
    participant FD as FeedbackDetector
    participant SSE as SessionSummaryExtractor
    participant CHI as ChatHistoryIndexer
    participant IW as IdleSessionWatcher
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant Chroma as Chroma
    participant LLM as LLM (fast)

    %% ===== Flow 1: 分析前 - 记忆检索注入 (同步) =====
    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
    Note over O,Chroma: Flow 1: build_context (同步, 分析前)
    O->>MM: build_context(user_id, query, params, analysis_type)
    MM->>LTM: search_by_type(user_id, query)
    LTM->>Chroma: vector similarity search
    Chroma-->>LTM: candidate memories
    LTM->>PG: filter by type + TTL + user_id
    PG-->>LTM: valid memories
    LTM-->>MM: ranked memories
    MM->>INJ: format_memory_injection(memories, analysis_type)
    Note over INJ: recency decay 加权排序
    INJ-->>MM: formatted context string
    MM-->>O: memory_context (注入 Prompt)
    end

    %% ===== Flow 2: 分析后 - 记忆提取 (fire-and-forget) =====
    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
    Note over O,PG: Flow 2: on_analysis_complete (异步, fire-and-forget)
    O-)MM: on_analysis_complete(result, session_id, params)
    MM-)EXT: asyncio.create_task(_extract_memories)
    EXT->>LLM: 提取记忆条目 (ENTITY_PROFILE / ANALYSIS_INSIGHT)
    LLM-->>EXT: extracted entries
    EXT->>LTM: store(entries)
    LTM->>PG: INSERT memories
    LTM->>Chroma: upsert embeddings
    end

    %% ===== Flow 3: 用户反馈检测 (fire-and-forget) =====
    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
    Note over O,PG: Flow 3: on_user_message (异步, 反馈检测)
    O-)MM: on_user_message(query, session_id)
    MM-)FD: asyncio.create_task(_extract_feedback)
    FD->>LLM: 分类: 是否为纠正/确认?
    LLM-->>FD: feedback_signal (CORRECTION / None)
    opt 检测到反馈
        FD->>LTM: store(CORRECTION memory, TTL=180d)
        LTM->>PG: INSERT
    end
    end

    %% ===== Flow 4: 聊天索引 (异步入队) =====
    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
    Note over O,PG: Flow 4: on_chat_message (异步入队)
    O-)MM: on_chat_message(session_id, role, content)
    MM-)CHI: enqueue(message)
    CHI->>CHI: 累积片段, 达到阈值后批量索引
    CHI->>PG: INSERT chat_index_fragments
    end

    %% ===== Flow 5: 会话空闲 - recap 生成 =====
    rect rgb(252, 228, 236)
    Note over IW,PG: Flow 5: on_session_idle (会话生命周期)
    IW->>IW: 检测 session 空闲超时
    IW->>MM: on_session_idle(session_id, user_id)
    MM->>SSE: extract(session_id, messages)
    SSE->>LLM: 生成会话摘要 (话题 + 实体 + 结论)
    LLM-->>SSE: recap_text
    SSE->>LTM: store(SESSION_RECAP, TTL=90d + recency decay)
    LTM->>PG: INSERT
    end
